---
title: Request replay flow
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant CLI
    participant Hist as History
    participant Rep as Replay
    participant Run as Runner

    CLI->>Hist: Get(42)
    Hist-->>CLI: Exchange
    CLI->>Rep: Apply overrides
    Rep->>Run: Do(request)
    Run-->>CLI: New exchange
    CLI->>Hist: Append as new ID
